yle="width:21%"></i></div><b>21</b></div></div><div class="card"><div class="row"><div class="chibi mini"><div class="cw"><div class="cb"><div class="shd"></div><div class="lg l"></div><div class="lg r"></div><div class="ar l" style="--o:#e9e9f2;--s:#d9a27c"></div><div class="ar r" style="--o:#e9e9f2;--s:#d9a27c"></div><div class="bd" style="background:#e9e9f2"><i></i></div><div class="hd" style="background:#d9a27c"><div class="hf" style="background:#8a6cff"></div><i class="e l"></i><i class="e r"></i><i class="bl l"></i><i class="bl r"></i><i class="mo"></i></div></div></div></div><div><b>Khánh Duy</b> <span class="small muted">Nam, 17 · năng khiếu Visual · tố chất x0.81</span></div><span class="sp"></span><button class="btn sm pri" onclick="sign(4)">Ký hợp đồng</button></div><div class="bars"><span>Vocal</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:4%"></i></div><b>4</b><span>Nhảy</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:3%"></i></div><b>3</b><span>Rap</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:9%"></i></div><b>9</b><span>Diễn xuất</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:12%"></i></div><b>12</b><span>Tạp kỹ</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:14%"></i></div><b>14</b><span>Visual</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:42%"></i></div><b>42</b><span>Thể lực</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:3%"></i></div><b>3</b></div></div>
